@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001

### Add a new task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy milk"
}

### Retrieve all tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos

### Delete a TODO
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/f8f26d81-06fc-4236-bbc6-90404591e1d5

POST http://localhost:5001/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Angular HttpClient"
}
